{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811", "id": 4155664072, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s73smbI", "number": 2811, "title": "libmavsdk.so exports statically linked curl/openssl symbols causing conflicts with ROS2 FastDDS middleware", "user": {"login": "pfilimonov", "id": 216424690, "node_id": "U_kgDODOZg8g", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216424690?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/pfilimonov", "html_url": "https://github.com/pfilimonov", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pfilimonov/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pfilimonov/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pfilimonov/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pfilimonov/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pfilimonov/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pfilimonov/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pfilimonov/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pfilimonov/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pfilimonov/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977269, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjk=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/enhancement", "name": "enhancement", "color": "84b6eb", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 3, "created_at": "2026-03-27T20:14:15Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-02T20:23:29Z", "closed_at": "2026-04-02T20:23:29Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi!. I've read that MavSDK is not really supposed to be used with ROS2 but nevertheless, I'd like to share a problem that I've found. \n\nWhen running a node with MavSDK under the hood (C++), I've been getting instant seg-faults until I switched from `rmw_fastrtps` to `rmw_zenoh_cpp`. I've tried to dig into the problem using AI since I don't really understand such a low-level subject.\n\nIt provides the following explanation:\n\n1. Problem: MAVSDK exports its statically linked curl symbols into the global dynamic linker namespace. When used alongside ROS2 with rmw_fastrtps_cpp, FastDDS resolves its curl calls to MAVSDK's internal version, causing a segfault in XMLProfileManager::loadDefaultXMLFile() at address 0xA.\n2. Proof command:\n```bash\nnm -D /lib/libmavsdk.so.3 | grep \"^[0-9a-f]* T curl_\"\n```\nThis shows curl symbols exported as public (T = global text symbol). They should be local/hidden.\nThe output of the command attached.\n\nI'm a big fan of both MavSDK and ROS2 so I would appreciate the fix so I will able to use them without any workarounds.\n\nThank you for your work gentlemen!\n\n[output.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26314048/output.txt)", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/4145029505", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811#issuecomment-4145029505", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811", "id": 4145029505, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s73ECGB", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-03-27T20:18:51Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-27T20:19:22Z", "body": "I think I agree that we should hide the symbols. I think we export all symbols by default which isn't quite the right way to go about this. I think we will have to have some sort of MAVSDK_EXPORT define to use for public APIs like other libraries do it.\n\n@JonasVautherin do you agree?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/4145029505/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/4148225249", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811#issuecomment-4148225249", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2811", "id": 4148225249, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s73QOTh", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.githu